The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository. Two sets of bundled
assets are NOT covered by it, and keep their own terms:

  public/fonts/*.woff2   Baloo 2 and Fredoka, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
                         See public/fonts/LICENSE.txt. Redistributing these
                         files requires that notice to travel with them.

  public/audio/game-*    Spoken clips generated with Microsoft Edge neural
  public/audio/kids-*    voices via msedge-tts. Free to generate, but
                         Microsoft's terms do not clearly grant the right to
                         redistribute the resulting audio. Treat them as
                         included for convenience, not as MIT-licensed, and
                         regenerate them if that distinction matters to you
                         (see the README's "Where the audio actually comes
                         from").

  public/audio/sfx-*     Synthesized from scratch with numpy, no samples.
                         Covered by the MIT licence above.
